{"title":"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems\">2010 AMC 12B #16</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 10B Problems\">2010 AMC 10B #18</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Minor_change_from_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Minor change from Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Fancier_version_of_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Fancier version of Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are randomly and independently selected with replacement from the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/62838b951e5c42023b54b5b6aab7778e88c3523f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1, 2, 3,\\dots, 2010\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />. What is the probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/6/bf6fd8a539280cecbe00bae8a42d59ce9340b279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc + ab + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"96\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/611e44813e12699950bdf87cd92b9def406dbbf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{3} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{29}{81} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{31}{81} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{11}{27} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{13}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"404\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We group this into groups of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/935972d2a68fb66c5d0d657f2af80a175d2a0e26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" />. This means that every residue class mod 3 has an equal probability.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/a/1aabe4e974b14ba4a8d96e60f0f2692c9d351938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" />, we are done. There is a probability of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> that that happens.\n</p><p>Otherwise, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e04faa2470dffe06d7c1c9f24a75d1557494c617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|bc+b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />, which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e79e623e09a98085178e818b2b2c3e28915e30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(c+1) \\equiv 2\\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"18\" />. So either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d602e48894f740c6b18b927d143632cd7c677267.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b \\equiv 1 \\pmod{3}, c \\equiv 1 \\pmod{3}\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07f3bfbde99b5d9adcd70b1baa3141a7b2d4d3e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b \\equiv 2 \\pmod {3}, c \\equiv 0 \\pmod 3\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" /> which will lead to the property being true. There is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd69512b5f5f4443ef16a385f1ac05b143cd39e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" /> chance for each bundle of cases to be true. Thus, the total for the cases is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/041a0b37ca609642fb34c7c855b9d67ed498a560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. But we have to multiply by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> because this case (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/4/e04faa2470dffe06d7c1c9f24a75d1557494c617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|bc+b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" /> ) only needs to happen when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> isn’t divisible by 3,  which has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance. So the total is actually <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89f8914ddec472f71365684baa2221159248682b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>The grand total is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdbc13df778bd61f5004a303c301f10b345310e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{4}{27} = \\boxed{\\text{(E) }\\frac{13}{27}.}\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Minor_change_from_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Minor_change_from_Solution_1)\">Solution 2 (Minor change from Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Minor change from Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just like solution 1, we see that there is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/a/1aabe4e974b14ba4a8d96e60f0f2692c9d351938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/041a0b37ca609642fb34c7c855b9d67ed498a560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> chance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef65944fdef0b6720b3b3909da09bd06812fe25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|1+b+bc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p>Now, we can just use PIE (Principles of Inclusion and Exclusion) to get our answer to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/b/dab4f3ac7b33c4a6233ee8e6e989e74a48822a8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{2}{9}-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2}{9} = \\boxed{\\text{(E) } \\frac{13}{27}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"199\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>-Conantwiz2023\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Fancier_version_of_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Fancier_version_of_Solution_1)\">Solution 3 (Fancier version of Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Fancier version of Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As with solution one, we conclude that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/589711c36462aa28840208b4a0ff371b70527d75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\equiv0\\mod 3$\" width=\"104\" height=\"12\" /> then the requirements are satisfied. We then have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/7/61770062c9a7dc3e9fc9513ed299beb7869cf456.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(bc+c)+a\\equiv0 \\mod 3\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/e/d2ec7b5b8242e2b0d6bcc8cc48cffc81dd6465cf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(bc+c)\\equiv-a \\mod 3\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245b5ede66663af6f908d73641325f8d7f4d7bda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c(b+1)\\equiv-1 \\mod 3\\]\" width=\"175\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c6d568232ca22886c1c3ecb474007ebad6ac10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b+1\\equiv \\frac{-1}{c} \\mod 3\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"37\" />\nWhich is true for one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/f/6af852f863e9d878b6aa7a161f7af4c79c196444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\not\\equiv 0 \\mod 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" /> because the integers<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/ccca648bede4198fd656121337d515b0709e6280.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod 3$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> form a field under multiplication and addition with absorbing element <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c9dc96482640e764713c03c761925871126eab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P=\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{4}{27}=\\boxed{\\text{(E) }\\frac{13}{27}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"183\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~Snacc\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FQO-0E2zUVI?t=437\">https://youtu.be/FQO-0E2zUVI?t=437</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B\">2010 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 1